  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan Health Pooled Fund Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide a government led effective health system that will deliver improved access to quality health services across seven states in South Sudan with a specific focus on reducing maternal and child mortality.  The Health Pooled Fund (HPF3) will reduce maternal and under-five mortality rates in South Sudan, through (i) the delivery of a basic package of health and nutrition services; (ii) promoting community engagement in health as a public good and (iii) supporting local health systems stabilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
